    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Memory loss; no headaches, weakness, tremor, falls or change in walking</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>No low mood, hallucinations, suspiciousness or irritability</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Asks people to repeat themselves in noisy rooms</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No low glucose spells he or his care partner has noticed</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

